sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant MP as 小程序
    participant Web as Web前台
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant WX as WxUtils
    participant DB as MySQL(user)
    participant JWT as JwtUtils
    Note over MP,JWT: 流程1 统一登录（Web+小程序互通）
    MP->>AC: POST /auth/wx-login {code}
    AC->>AS: wxLogin(code)
    AS->>WX: code2session(code)
    WX-->>AS: openid
    AS->>DB: select user where openid=?
    alt 不存在则自动建号
        AS->>DB: insert user(openid)
    end
    AS->>JWT: generate(uid, role=student)
    AS-->>MP: {token, userInfo}
    Web->>AC: POST /auth/login {studentNo, password}
    AC->>AS: login()
    AS->>DB: 查用户+BCrypt校验+状态检查
    AS->>JWT: generate(uid, role=student)
    AS-->>Web: {token, userInfo}
